{"name": "Battle Vision", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/145760ff3dcea62783af4e929ee24cef.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"600\"/></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The most-watched tournament in the known universe just kicked off, and you're leading a crew. The objective is simple: draft your team, exploit your opponents weaknesses, and send them home crying. Just make sure you look awesome doing it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras_big/c97efd295b555888bcc0f66a811e6ca0.webp?t=1789755599\" height=\"67\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/c97efd295b555888bcc0f66a811e6ca0.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn is a puzzle of min-maxing and strategizing. Position your team, set up your attack, and time it right to punch through the enemy's <span class=\"bb_strike\">face</span> defense. Then sit back and relish in the satisfaction of your victory. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/993dbefa2c9bf2ac1ef0236aa0c7915d.poster.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/993dbefa2c9bf2ac1ef0236aa0c7915d.webm?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/993dbefa2c9bf2ac1ef0236aa0c7915d.mp4?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras_big/e0aa50d525ea6b815f906c4862001547.webp?t=1789755599\" height=\"93\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/e0aa50d525ea6b815f906c4862001547.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tournament bracket branches, and so does your risk. Take the easier lane and coast (in theory), or dive into the brutal route where the rewards (and the pain) hit twice as hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/00287ef23ee70f880bb1bbc8b56c791e.poster.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/00287ef23ee70f880bb1bbc8b56c791e.webm?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/00287ef23ee70f880bb1bbc8b56c791e.mp4?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras_big/f07e57347bffec72c3ee86e8f78b9a76.webp?t=1789755599\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/f07e57347bffec72c3ee86e8f78b9a76.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small, start weak. Win and lose your way to new units, then stack captain abilities, unit effects, Performance Enhancers*, and consumables until your strategy stops looking like a game plan and starts looking like a series of increasingly unhinged but secretly genius mastermind decisions. The galaxy's other teams have tricks and synergies of their own, so figure out theirs before they figure out yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> **Performance Enhancements are definitely above board and not at all suspicious in any way.*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ff75f96a91315da7d19976f1947f8128.poster.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ff75f96a91315da7d19976f1947f8128.webm?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ff75f96a91315da7d19976f1947f8128.mp4?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras_big/4f74e3d208696f7e33a5f4fee2a44b41.webp?t=1789755599\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/4f74e3d208696f7e33a5f4fee2a44b41.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique, so every run is a brand new opportunity for glory! \u2026or humiliation. Those pesky foes always have some new trick up their sleeve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/78e1bf2198292ea48ba38751aa284215.poster.avif?t=1789755599\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/78e1bf2198292ea48ba38751aa284215.webm?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/78e1bf2198292ea48ba38751aa284215.mp4?t=1789755599\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit. Strategize. DOMINATE WITHOUT MERCY. And then do it all again, because season 12,000,000,001 is just around the corner.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Battle your way to fame and glory in this cosmic tactical puzzle-battle roguelike! Recruit your ultimate team, equip them with powerful abilities and take them on a season-long run of domination in the universe\u2019s most-watched battle-sport!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/fd2bf1f92d0026a6f04585d17119af6151257f69/header.jpg?t=1789755599", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Singleplayer", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelike", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Capybara Games", "publishers": "Capybara Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2216850", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EQ0ydAw6H2s", "first_seen": 1789682400.0, "review_rank": 28}